ips"},{"text":"Use positive reinforcement"},{"text":"Maintain student safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Effective classroom cycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clear Expectations","Predictable Routine","Active Engagement","Positive Reinforcement","Early Intervention"]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal should be to create a safe and engaging learning environment, not simply to control students."}]},{"heading":"Assessment at Primary Level","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Assessment should identify what children understand and where they need support."},{"type":"h","text":"Formative assessment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oral questions"},{"text":"Reading activities"},{"text":"Worksheets"},{"text":"Games"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Short quizzes"},{"text":"Classroom tasks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Summative assessment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unit tests"},{"text":"Term examinations"},{"text":"Projects"},{"text":"Portfolio assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment cycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Teach","Observe","Assess","Analyze","Identify Gap","Remediate","Reassess"]}]},{"heading":"Remedial Teaching","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong PRT should be able to identify learning difficulties early."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"If a child struggles with reading:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reading Assessment","Identify Specific Difficulty","Phonics / Vocabulary Support","Guided Reading","Repeated Practice","Progress Check"]},{"type":"h","text":"Remedial strategies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smaller learning steps"},{"text":"Additional practice"},{"text":"Visual aids"},{"text":"Peer learning"},{"text":"One-to-one support"},{"text":"Repetition"},{"text":"Multisensory activities"}]}]},{"heading":"Inclusive Education","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Primary classrooms may include children with different:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning abilities"},{"text":"Languages"},{"text":"Disabilities"},{"text":"Socioeconomic backgrounds"},{"text":"Cultural backgrounds"},{"text":"Developmental needs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Differentiated instruction"},{"text":"Accessible learning materials"},{"text":"Flexible classroom activities"},{"text":"Peer support"},{"text":"Appropriate accommodations"},{"text":"Collaboration with parents and specialists"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inclusive classroom model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Common Learning Goal","Different Learning Supports","Flexible Activities","Individual Assistance","Progress Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Child Safety & Safeguarding","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PRT has an important responsibility for child safety."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Child protection"},{"text":"Safe classroom practices"},{"text":"Bullying prevention"},{"text":"Online safety"},{"text":"Appropriate teacher-student boundaries"},{"text":"Recognizing signs of distress"},{"text":"Escalation/reporting procedures"},{"text":"Teachers should follow the applicable child-protection laws, school policies and reporting procedures."}]}]},{"heading":"Parent & Community Engagement","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Primary education requires close communication with families."},{"type":"h","text":"Parent interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Discuss:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic progress"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Learning difficulties"},{"text":"Classroom behavior"},{"text":"Strengths"},{"text":"Areas requiring support"},{"text":"Home-learning strategies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication principle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Observe","Document","Explain Clearly","Listen to Parent","Agree on Support","Follow Up"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid labeling children based on a single academic or behavioral observation."}]},{"heading":"Educational Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern PRTs should be comfortable using digital tools."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Digital boards"},{"text":"Online quizzes"},{"text":"Educational videos"},{"text":"Learning-management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful classroom technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interactive presentations"},{"text":"Digital worksheets"},{"text":"Online formative assessment"},{"text":"Educational games"},{"text":"Digital storytelling"},{"text":"Basic coding/logic activities"}]}]},{"heading":"AI for Primary Education","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist teachers with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson-plan ideas"},{"text":"Story generation"},{"text":"Worksheet creation"},{"text":"Differentiated exercises"},{"text":"Quiz generation"},{"text":"Vocabulary activities"},{"text":"Reading materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Teacher Objective","AI-Assisted Draft","Teacher Verification","Age & Curriculum Check","Adapt to Student Needs","Classroom Use"]},{"type":"p","text":"Teachers should never blindly use AI-generated educational content."}]},{"heading":"Projects During Teacher Education","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Foundational Literacy Kit"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an educational kit containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Phonics cards"},{"text":"Vocabulary cards"},{"text":"Reading activities"},{"text":"Short stories"},{"text":"Comprehension questions"},{"text":"Writing exercises"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Foundational Numeracy Kit"},{"type":"p","text":"Create activities for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Counting"},{"text":"Addition"},{"text":"Subtraction"},{"text":"Multiplication"},{"text":"Fractions"},{"text":"Shapes"},{"text":"Measurement"},{"text":"Use physical manipulatives wherever possible."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Learn